#!/usr/bin/env bash
# compose-directive — spawn-time stack awareness (agent bridge).
# Optional lego: no hard deps on herdr, herdr-spine, or tup — paths are hints.
# Usage: compose-directive <profile> [harness] [loop_phase] [from-name] [parent-name]
set -euo pipefail

DIR="$(cd "$(dirname "$0")" && pwd)"
PROFILE="${1:-concierge}"
HARNESS="${2:-}"
PHASE="${3:-}"
FROM_NAME="${4:-}"
PARENT_NAME="${5:-}"
LOOP="$DIR/loop-phases.json"

role="${PROFILE%%:*}"
domain="" phase="" function="" rank=""

if command -v jq >/dev/null 2>&1 && [[ -f "$LOOP" ]]; then
  domain="$(jq -r --arg r "$role" '.roles[$r].domain // empty' "$LOOP")"
  function="$(jq -r --arg r "$role" '.roles[$r].function // empty' "$LOOP")"
  rank="$(jq -r --arg r "$role" '.roles[$r].rank // empty' "$LOOP")"
  if [[ -z "$PHASE" ]]; then
    PHASE="$(jq -r --arg r "$role" '.roles[$r].default_phase // empty' "$LOOP")"
  fi
  if [[ -n "$domain" && -n "$PHASE" ]]; then
    phase="$(jq -r --arg d "$domain" --arg p "$PHASE" \
      '.domains[$d].phase_names[$p] // $p' "$LOOP")"
  fi
fi

cat <<EOF
## Agent bridge (spawn-time)

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Role | ${role} |
| Function | ${function:-[UNKNOWN]} |
| Loop domain | ${domain:-[UNKNOWN]} |
| Loop phase | ${PHASE:-[UNKNOWN]}${phase:+ — ${phase}} |
| Harness | ${HARNESS:-desk default} |

Stack awareness (grab what you need; no hard coupling):
- **Herdr** — multiplexer: panes, tabs, \`herdr agent …\`, fleet topology.
- **Spawn door** — \`~/bin/spine-spawn\` (orch/worker/fanout/desk): profile prompt + model + verified submit.
- **Tup** — durable half: \`~/tup/durable/cli.py\`, \`~/tup/field/field.py\` deposit, bellman at \`~/tup/socket/bellman.py\`.
- **Profiles** — \`~/agent-core/primitives/profiles/\` + \`profile-model get\`.
- **Comms** — \`~/agent-core/primitives/rules/comms-arch.md\` plane 5 (stigmergic field).

Comms contract:
- Parent: ${PARENT_NAME:-[UNKNOWN]}
- From: ${FROM_NAME:-[UNKNOWN]}
- Deposit (tup field only; not the operator pane): \`python3 ~/tup/field/field.py deposit --from ${FROM_NAME:-[UNKNOWN]} --to ${PARENT_NAME:-[UNKNOWN]} --kind done --body "<evidence>"\`
- Two stopping states only: every done-when met with evidence, or \`need-help\` naming owner after finishing independent work.
- Empty inbox is not a stop.
- "I did not edit product" is not a stop.
- \`report\` is not \`done\`.
- Herdr sidebar: \`~/herdr-spine/bin/spine-report\`
- \`nQ\` to operator is \`0\`
- Dead claimant recovery: UNKNOWN

This block is prepended at spawn for every pane (orch/worker/fanout/desk). Concierge gets the composed harness directive; workers get constructed prompt + this block.
EOF
